# RoboSketch-RL - the paper sheet.
#
# A flat unit quad in the XY plane (-1..+1) with explicit UV coordinates
# covering the full 0..1 texture range, scaled at load time via meshScale.
#
# Why a mesh and not p.GEOM_BOX: a PyBullet box does NOT map a full texture
# across each face - its top face samples only a small uniform patch of the
# image (measured: an entire quadrant-coloured texture rendered as one flat
# colour). Drawings painted onto a box are therefore mostly invisible.
# This quad maps the whole canvas onto the sheet, 1:1.
v -1.0 -1.0 0.0
v  1.0 -1.0 0.0
v  1.0  1.0 0.0
v -1.0  1.0 0.0
vt 0.0 0.0
vt 1.0 0.0
vt 1.0 1.0
vt 0.0 1.0
vn 0.0 0.0 1.0
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1
f 1/1/1 3/3/1 4/4/1
